    "methods_description": "Participants completed counterbalanced fMRI and EEG sessions at least two weeks apart, listening to four sections of the audiobook (about 20 minutes total) with five yes/no comprehension questions after each section. T1-weighted structural scans and resting-state fMRI were also collected. Cognitive tasks (digit span, picture naming, verbal fluency, Flanker) and the LHQ3 and LEQ questionnaires were administered.",
